1. DAX Analysis report page
Component	What to include
Card 1	Electronics Sales – CALCULATE()
Card 2	YTD Sales – DATESYTD()
Table	OrderDate and Running Total
Card 3	Profit Margin – Percentage
Text box	Context Transition explanation

2. DAX formulas used
Electronics Sales:
Electronics Sales =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(sales_data[Sales]),
    sales_data[Category] = "Electronics"
)

YTD Sales:
YTD Sales =
CALCULATE(
    [Total Sales],
    DATESYTD(sales_data[OrderDate])
)

Running Total calculated column:
Running Total =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(sales_data[Sales]),
    FILTER(
        sales_data,
        sales_data[OrderDate] <=
        EARLIER(sales_data[OrderDate])
    )
)

Profit Margin calculated column:
Profit Margin Column =
DIVIDE(
    sales_data[Profit],
    sales_data[Sales],
    0
)